== Stage 5d: Matrix equivalence - Dolphin GeoTIFF vs MintPy HDF5 ==
This validates that MintPy ifgramStack.h5 datasets preserve Dolphin raster matrices.
It reads data in row blocks; it does not load the full stack into RAM.
For connectComponent, source nodata pixels are excluded from equality metrics.

